    "detailed_description": "<h1>OUR GAMES</h1><p><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2314050/extras/023a2088fdfac9bca7ef861c9fddaa6b.avif?t=1733508637\" /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2314050/extras/1bedac4b6305dcc24b9f96ac30a2680d.avif?t=1733508637\" /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2314050/extras/e209a6efb2046adde4ba331a2b972ced.avif?t=1733508637\" /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2314050/extras/107e99f1e49381f5d997efd0b30548bc.avif?t=1733508637\" /></span></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1>In Waifu Space Conquest you can play a nostalgic arcade game.<br><br>Conquer all the space to pass the level. Confine the aliens in your claimed space to kill them. <br>Think fast. Use all the power-ups available and be ready to keep going.<br>The enemies become stronger and more dangerous will you be able to claim their territory?<br><br>Enjoy the cyberpunk aesthetic. And unlock images as you go.\t<br><br><br>Features:<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>50 Levels<br></li><li>Beautiful mix of pixel art and HD<br></li><li>Image gallery<br></li><li>6 different power-ups<br></li><li>6 types of enemies</li></ul><br>",
